    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54dce91d666212effffb7888",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我也将继续向前。\n踏上那无路之路，\n走上那任何独奏家都不曾走过的路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "814040414008e684fb453b206a8b644f3934493eadc4842c62da3e165d7688a1",
